    Bug 2011814 - Adjust Find dialog calls to nsIFind Replace All (port bug 1945862). r=tobyp,jjaschke


    Rewrite onReplaceAll() to always scan the full document (forward from start to end, backward from end to start).

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D301607

